## A lantern in the snow

@narrator: The last hound drops something as it flees: a lantern, cracked, with a single star inside.
@lumi{emotion="surprised"}: That's Nell! She lived next to me! She owes me a comet!
@narrator: The glass breaks. A pinprick of light shoots up and sticks to the sky.
@aria{emotion="happy"}: Nine thousand nine hundred and... well. One more.
@lumi: The keep's past the mountains. The road there isn't open yet. We'll need a lot more stars.
